Launch the full 16-sample HRA003336 WGBS cohort with the resilient v2 workflow.

Operational changes are evidence-driven from run 32610158789: reduce concurrent source pressure to four samples, resume interrupted CNCB transfers with repeated MD5 verification, use the official DunedinPACE +/-500 bp windows with a conservative +/-1000 bp screening reference, and retain complete hg19 + MAPQ >=30 for final candidate alignment.
